"role":"卒","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o166b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0131","role":"亡去","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o166b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":252,"label":"太元二年春正月至二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y252","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o166","basis":"太元二年春正月至二月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o166b-q","wuzhu-q-o166","shaodi-q-o052","shaodi-q-b-20272e7cc5379b3fe346"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o166b-q","source_order":[47,814,"O166b"],"order":8415}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0131","name":"王表","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o162"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o162-wuzhu-p0131","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o162"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o163-wuzhu-p0131","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o163"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o166-wuzhu-p0131","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o166"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-o030","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-3246574a0401a9de5d60","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平三年正月，畅薨，追赠车骑将军，谥曰恭侯。子绍嗣。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：嘉平三年（公元 251）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-563b7a630850bbcc0541","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-20272e7cc5379b3fe346","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-20272e7cc5379b3fe346","layer":"modern","quote":"〖17〗四年：嘉平四年（公元252）。癸卯：旧历初二日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-db96ad991a403b6a010e","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"shaodi-q-o048","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-214613f5a625f33a352f","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，荆州刺史王基、新城太守（陈）〔州〕泰攻吴〖2〗。破之，降者数千口。二月，置南郡之夷陵县以居降附〖3〗。三月，以尚书令司马孚为司空〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77},{"id":"shaodi-q-o052","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-944c76689fd8a3e8fa86","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月，癸卯〖17〗，以抚军大将军司马景王为大将军。二月，立皇后张氏〖18〗，大赦。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o162b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-671499ac1e4476e8a616","layer":"original","quote":"初，临海罗阳县有神〖2〗，自称王表；﹝一﹞周旋民间，语言饮食，与人无异，然不见其形。又有一婢，名纺绩。是月，遣中书郎李崇，赍辅国将军、罗阳王印绶，迎表〖3〗。表随崇俱出，与崇及所在郡守、令长谈论，崇等无以易〖4〗。所历山川，辄遣婢与其神相闻。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":23,"end":144},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o163a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-c1883440539f9e6e457b","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，崇与表至；权于苍龙门外为立第舍〖5〗，数使近臣赍酒食往。表说水旱小事，往往有验。﹝二﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":299,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o166b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-b62c4eca93eda253f3b0","layer":"original","quote":"二月，大赦，改元为神凤。皇后潘氏薨。诸将吏数诣王表请福，表亡去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":302,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":57,"end":89},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o162","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-671499ac1e4476e8a616","layer":"original","quote":"太元元年夏五月，立皇后潘氏〖1〗。大赦，改年。初，临海罗阳县有神〖2〗，自称王表；﹝一﹞周旋民间，语言饮食，与人无异，然不见其形。又有一婢，名纺绩。是月，遣中书郎李崇，赍辅国将军、罗阳王印绶，迎表〖3〗。表随崇俱出，与崇及所在郡守、令长谈论，崇等无以易〖4〗。所历山川，辄遣婢与其神相闻。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":144},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o163","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-c1883440539f9e6e457b","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，崇与表至；权于苍龙门外为立第舍〖5〗，数使近臣赍酒食往。表说水旱小事，往往有验。﹝二﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":299,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o166","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-b62c4eca93eda253f3b0","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖12〗，立故太子和为南阳王，居长沙〖13〗；子奋为齐王，居武昌；子休为琅邪王〖14〗，居虎林〖15〗。二月，大赦，改元为神凤。皇后潘氏薨。诸将吏数诣王表请福，表亡去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":302,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":89},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p072-judgment","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-268ed3534c5cf830a482","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞孙盛曰：“盛闻国将兴，听于民；国将亡，听于神。权年老志衰，谗臣在侧；废嫡立庶，以妾为妻：可谓多凉德矣。而伪设符命，求福妖邪；将亡之兆，不亦显乎！”","attribution":"孙盛论","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-51280e2cac3f9883b95f","start":0,"end":76}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
